digraph UML { graph [rankdir=TB,bgcolor="transparent",pad="0.12",nodesep="0.36",ranksep="0.7",splines=polyline];
node [shape=plain]; edge [color="#687d9a",penwidth=1.45,arrowsize=0.85];
"Shape" [label=<<TABLE BORDER="1" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" COLOR="#91a7c3" BGCOLOR="#fbfdff"><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#e8eeff" CELLPADDING="7"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="13">&lt;&lt;abstract&gt;&gt;<BR/><I>Shape</I></FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#e1e7f0" HEIGHT="2"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c">- name : String</FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#e1e7f0" HEIGHT="2"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c">+ Shape(name : String)</FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c">+ getName() : String</FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c"><I>+ getArea() : double</I></FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c"><I>+ getPerimeter() : double</I></FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c">+ isLargerThan(other : Shape) : boolean</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>>];
"Rectangle" [label=<<TABLE BORDER="1" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" COLOR="#91a7c3" BGCOLOR="#fbfdff"><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#e8eeff" CELLPADDING="7"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="13"><B>Rectangle</B></FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#e1e7f0" HEIGHT="2"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c">- width : double</FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c">- height : double</FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#e1e7f0" HEIGHT="2"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c">+ Rectangle(name : String, width : double, height : double)</FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c">+ getArea() : double</FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c">+ getPerimeter() : double</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>>];
"Circle" [label=<<TABLE BORDER="1" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" COLOR="#91a7c3" BGCOLOR="#fbfdff"><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#e8eeff" CELLPADDING="7"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="13"><B>Circle</B></FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#e1e7f0" HEIGHT="2"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c">- radius : double</FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD BGCOLOR="#e1e7f0" HEIGHT="2"></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c">+ Circle(name : String, radius : double)</FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c">+ getArea() : double</FONT></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT" CELLPADDING="5"><FONT FACE="DejaVu Sans Mono" POINT-SIZE="10" COLOR="#27364c">+ getPerimeter() : double</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>>];
"Rectangle" -> "Shape" [arrowhead=empty];
"Circle" -> "Shape" [arrowhead=empty];
}
